    "html": "<section class=\"r6v4-row\" aria-labelledby=\"r6v4-title\">\n  <div class=\"r6v4-inner\">\n    <div class=\"r6v4-head\">\n      <p class=\"r6v4-eyebrow\">For Movies</p>\n      <h2 class=\"r6v4-title\" id=\"r6v4-title\">From FADE IN to opening night.</h2>\n      <p class=\"r6v4-lede\">Five minutes or three hours, the path is the same. You write the page. ACT 3 boards it, casts it, builds the set and renders every shot, and stops for your yes at each step. Then it plays.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"r6v4-stripwrap\">\n    <ol class=\"r6v4-strip\" aria-label=\"Four stages of one scene of Low Tide, from script page to screen\">\n      <li class=\"r6v4-cell\">\n        <div class=\"r6v4-frame\"><img src=\"/v4/row_6/v/page.jpg\" width=\"1000\" height=\"366\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"r6v4-img-page\"\n          alt=\"A screenplay page: EXT. BEACH, GOLDEN HOUR. JACK: Have you seen my dog? He ran this way. SALLY: No. Can I help you look for him?\"></div>\n        <p class=\"r6v4-step\"><span>01</span> The page</p>\n        <p class=\"r6v4-who\">You write it. Dialogue and a few lines of what you see.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"r6v4-cell\">\n        <div class=\"r6v4-frame\"><img src=\"/v4/row_6/v/board.jpg\" width=\"1000\" height=\"589\" loading=\"lazy\"\n          alt=\"A pencil storyboard panel of Jack and Sally walking the waterline, with arrows for their direction.\"></div>\n        <p class=\"r6v4-step\"><span>02</span> The board</p>\n        <p class=\"r6v4-who\">ACT 3 boards every shot. You approve the framing.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"r6v4-cell\">\n        <div class=\"r6v4-frame\"><img src=\"/v4/row_6/v/frame.jpg\" width=\"1000\" height=\"559\" loading=\"lazy\"\n          alt=\"The finished two-shot: Jack with the striped surfboard and Sally on the golden-hour beach.\"></div>\n        <p class=\"r6v4-step\"><span>03</span> The shot</p>\n        <p class=\"r6v4-who\">Same cast, same set, lit the way you asked.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"r6v4-cell\">\n        <div class=\"r6v4-frame\"><img src=\"/v4/row_6/v/screen.jpg\" width=\"1000\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"\n          alt=\"The same beach scene on a cinema screen, the front rows of an audience in silhouette.\"></div>\n        <p class=\"r6v4-step\"><span>04</span> The screen</p>\n        <p class=\"r6v4-who\">Your movie, finished and exported to where it plays.</p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"r6v4-inner r6v4-foot\">\n    <p class=\"r6v4-note\">One scene of Low Tide, our example film, at four stages.</p>\n    <a class=\"r6v4-cta\" href=\"https://app.act3ai.com/signup/\">Start with page one <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
